<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>隐藏相册隐藏</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>已隐藏相簿</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>开启后，相簿「已隐藏」内的照片与视频不会显示，画面会显示「无照片或视频」。关闭后恢复显示原本内容。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>隐藏「已隐藏」相簿的内容</string>
